Files ported or adapted from Universal Modder (each carries a notice at its top):

    bin/wise                              from bin/um
    hooks/add-to-path.sh, hooks/hooks.json   from hooks/
    wisecraft/cli.py                      from um/cli.py
    wisecraft/common.py                   from um/common.py
    wisecraft/video.py                    from um/video.py
    wisecraft/fonts/                      from um/fonts/ (unchanged)
    tests/test_wise.py, tests/test_web.py from tests/test_um.py (the ported tests and a helper)
    knowledge/TEMPLATE.md, knowledge/README.md   from knowledge/ (the field-note format)
    AGENTS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md, .github/   adapted from the files of the same name
    plugin.json, .claude-plugin/, .codex-plugin/, .cursor-plugin/, .agents/plugins/, gemini-extension.json,
